5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like for people! I'll look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think it's important to know the costs, so I'll check the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a look at the ward complaint log for this point and the station block's meeting minutes to see how others handled the friction.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'll check the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the statements at the residents' meeting. I want to know if people are actually willing to follow the rules.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk to see what is actually feasible.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Does anyone else think we should check the meeting minutes? @Shunichi, let me know if you find anything scary in there!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm sure it will be fine, Rin. I'm just hoping the costs aren't too high for everyone to manage comfortably.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I'll keep you posted. I'm more interested in whether they ended up hating each other than anything ""scary.""","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm more worried about who ends up doing all the work. @Asuka, do those filing requirements look like a nightmare to handle?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I cannot say yet, as I haven't looked into them. I will report back once I have the facts.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm just so excited to see that bin house! I bet it looks like a little castle for trash. @Midori, do you think the ward gives money for decorations too?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm not sure, Rin, but I think the subsidy is probably just for the basic structure. Let's focus on the essentials first so we don't overspend.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori is right. Let's not get carried away with ""trash castles"" until we know if we can even agree on where the bins go without starting a war.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"Exactly. I'm more concerned about the human element. If we set a strict schedule, I want to know if people will actually stick to it or just ignore it.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,That is why I am checking the frontage measurements. A plan is only as good as the physical space available to implement it fairly.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I hope we can all be friends no matter what we pick! I'll go check on those things now. See you all soon!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll get started on the financial side of things. I hope we can find a solution that makes everyone feel comfortable and happy.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll go dig through the complaints and minutes. Let's see if we can find a way to fix the bins without breaking the neighborhood.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'll go find out about the truck and the residents' opinions. I'll be back soon with the real story on whether this is actually doable.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will proceed with the measurements and the filing requirements. I look forward to seeing the data we collect.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
